  "rules": [
    "The list is net. The engine grosses up once, at the end, and Dante says that one final number. ADR 0020.",
    "Quantities are the ones in the tables: 1, 2, 4, 6, 8, 10 and 20 talonarios. Nothing between them is quoted.",
    "A complete 7 x 2 x 2. Every one of the twenty eight amounts is one the owner typed.",
    "The three surcharges are percentages of the chosen row, and papel quimico differs by format. When more than one applies they compound, one on the other, never summed.",
    "No module. A size the customer gives escalates rather than being priced by area.",
    "A quote is valid 15 days, and after that while the list has not changed."
  ]
